            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and work in continuous rounds. The tail is a wide capsule, bigger than the legs, and gives the fox its character."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "White DK yarn, approx. 33 g. Black DK yarn, small amount for nose and eye area. 3.5 mm crochet hook. Tapestry needle. Craft scissors. Soft measuring tape. Pair of 10 mm "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-safety-eyes-af"
